# Glow, Shiver and Tide: the newest interpretation recipes
tap EDIT
wait 300
expect xpar0_0 52
expect xbaseunchanged 1
listen
where
said Preset Glow
shot expression-glow.png
tap EDIT
wait 300
expect xpar0_0 46
expect xbaseunchanged 1
listen
where
said Preset Shiver
shot expression-shiver.png
tap EDIT
wait 300
expect xpar0_0 60
expect xbaseunchanged 1
listen
where
